jobs_results.description:
This a Full Remote job, the offer is available from: Spain

This is a remote position.

We are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior QA Test Engineer with 6+ years of test experience with complex web application platforms for an international organization in New York. Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. This position is open for freelancers and employees.

Candidates need to be able to work +5 hours per day in the normal office hours of New York, US. (Example 9 AM NY time equals 7:30 PM.)

Tasks and deliverables:
• Create test automation scripts from the ground up using an Automated testing framework in several simultaneous projects;
• Responsible for developing, modifying, and executing test scripts and analyzing bugs;
• Perform automated and manual testing on a variety of web browsers and operating systems;
• Run various tests on new software products to ensure that applications satisfy all specifications and requirements;
• Record all defect... details, creating and distributing reports outlining the types of defects found and the steps taken to resolve these issues and update the regression test framework;
• Automate API testing using Postman and similar tools;
• Work closely with developers to recognize the potential for any operational issues, assess risks, and resolve issues proactively
• Maintain knowledgebase documentation in SharePoint
• All tasks will be assigned in a Kanban type process by the Technical Lead, with progress being tracked in daily team meetings (morning hours EST time zone)
• Tasks will be considered completed after sign-off by the business owner or Technical Lead;

Profile:
• Bachelor or Master degree;
• 6+ years of experience as Test Engineer for complex web application platforms;
• Experience performing manual testing and executing scripted test cases;
• Experience with test automation;
• Experience with security testing, integration testing, API testing, end-to-end testing, and load testing;
• Experience with Mobile application testing, browser compatibility, and accessibility testing experience;
• Experience in identifying, analyzing, documenting, and reporting test results;

Offered:
• A challenging role for an international organization in New York;
• Attractive salary package;

Interested:

If you have the determination for a rewarding career, please send your CV to us via apply@goproconsultancy.com or call us on +94 114312515 for more information.

This offer from "GoPro Consultancy" has been enriched by Jobgether.com and got a 72% flex score

